  "title": "The integrated system of Nature-based Solutions to mitigate floods and drought risks in the Serchio River Basin (Italy)",
  "summary": "Massaciuccoli Lake faces vulnerability due to agricultural drainage and nutrient influx. The EU Horizon 2020 Phusicos Project employs Nature-Based Solutions to combat climate change effects, enhance ecosystem resilience, and reduce pollutants, using a participative \"Living Lab\" approach for innovation testing and validation. Massaciuccoli Lake (7 km 2 wide and about 2 m deep) is a coastal lake surrounded by marshy areas that are part of the Serchio river basin. Large part of the basin has been drained for agricultural purposes since 1930 by means of a complex network of artificial ditches and pumping stations forcing water from the drained areas into the lake.",
